# Real-posting scoring benchmarks contain posting text and private human labels.
# Keep historical location-gate and all U.S. role-fit frozen inputs,
# active/backup labels, role/location report-only reevaluations, comparison
# data, and evaluator metrics local while docs/tests stay trackable.
# Private frozen benchmarks, holdout artifacts, and their health reports never
# enter Git.
evaluation/private/
evaluation/scoring_*_labels.csv
evaluation/scoring_*_rows.jsonl
evaluation/scoring_*_predictions.json
evaluation/scoring_*_manifest.json
evaluation/scoring_*_report.md
evaluation/scoring_*_metrics.json

# Local watcher scratch artifacts
# Ad-hoc timing captures from isolated watcher runs are operational scratch.
watcher-timing*.json
watcher/watcher-timing*.json
# Local performance-audit summaries stay scratch; reusable profiler scripts
# and regression fixtures remain trackable.
watcher-performance*.json
watcher/watcher-performance*.json
# Local analysis benchmark captures are scratch; the reusable benchmark
# harness and equivalence tests stay tracked.
analysis-benchmark*.json
watcher/analysis-benchmark*.json
# Local disabled/cold/warm cache benchmark summaries are scratch; cache code
# and offline regression fixtures remain visible.
analysis-cache-benchmark*.json
watcher/analysis-cache-benchmark*.json
# Downloaded or extracted GitHub Actions verification bundles, including
# scheduled-delivery diagnostics, stay outside source control; direct JSON
# extracts are also covered by report rules below.
.gh-run-artifacts/
github-actions-verification*/
watcher-diagnostics-*/
watcher-diagnostics-*.zip
# Throwaway probe/debug scripts run from the repository root.
_probe*.py
_scratch*.py
# Local eligibility demonstrations are audit scratch; regression fixtures stay
# visible for review.
eligibility-demo*.json
# Read-only audit/comparison exports may contain operational posting metadata.
watcher-audit*.json
watcher-source-comparison*.json
source-comparison*.json
watcher/source-comparison-redesign*.json
# Temporary bounded-persistence stress demonstrations are never production
# state or fixtures.
comparison-stress*.sqlite
comparison-stress*.json
# Repository audit scratch output is local unless promoted to a fixture.
code-audit*.json
code-audit*.log
repository-audit*.json
repository-audit*.log
# Temporary notification-state integration reports belong outside source
# control; their SQLite databases are covered by the global SQLite patterns.
watcher-notification-integration*.json
watcher/notification-integration*.json
watcher/add_company_batch.txt
watcher/additions_detect.json
watcher/additions_report.md
watcher/additions_watchlist.yml
# Optional machine-readable source-health reports generated by
# WATCHER_HEALTH_REPORT_PATH / --health-report. Keep the Python module and
# offline JSON fixtures trackable by limiting these to explicit report names.
watcher-health*.json
watcher-source-health*.json
health-report*.json
source-health*.json
watcher/health-report*.json
watcher/source-health*.json
# Sanitized summaries from isolated reliability probes belong outside source
# control even when a local run writes them in the repository root.
watcher-reliability-probe*.json
watcher/reliability-probe*.json
# Isolated GitHub backstop probe summaries and logs are operational scratch.
github-backstop-probe*.json
github-backstop-probe*.log
watcher/github-backstop-probe*.json
watcher/github-backstop-probe*.log
# Local direct-adapter probe captures must not become fixtures accidentally.
workday-live-probe*.json
workday-live-probe*.log
watcher/workday-live-probe*.json
watcher/workday-live-probe*.log
# Safe Workday transport probe output is operational scratch data. The probe
# script and offline test fixtures remain trackable.
workday-transport-probe*.json
workday-transport-probe*.log
watcher/workday-transport-probe*.json
watcher/workday-transport-probe*.log
# Collection snapshots contain full posting text and are local replay inputs.
*.json.gz
collection-snapshots/
watcher/collection-snapshots/
# Replay benchmark reports may include local paths and production row counts.
collection-replay-benchmark*.json
watcher/collection-replay-benchmark*.json
# Focused replay profiler captures are local diagnostics.
warm-replay-profile*.prof
warm-replay-profile*.json
warm-replay-profile*.log
watcher/warm-replay-profile*.prof
watcher/warm-replay-profile*.json
watcher/warm-replay-profile*.log
# Static-scoring cache benchmark reports are local performance diagnostics.
static-scoring-cache-benchmark*.json
watcher/static-scoring-cache-benchmark*.json
# Collection-concurrency benchmarks, retained canary evidence, Workday
# start-spacing telemetry, and blocked-source state files remain local. Reusable
# benchmark/canary scripts and offline regression tests stay tracked.
collection-concurrency*.json
watcher/collection-concurrency*.json
canary-limited*.json
canary-full*.json
concurrent-canary*.json
collection-canary-state*.json
watcher/collection-canary-state*.json
# Regression, cleanup, integration, push, worktree, and verification logs are
# local diagnostics, not source artifacts.
cleanup-audit*.log
cleanup-audit*.json
watcher/cleanup-audit*.log
watcher/cleanup-audit*.json
# Local hosted-backend promotion verification output.
hosted-backend-promotion*.log
hosted-backend-push*.log
# Prompt-maintained guidance, bug-audit, and branch-handoff scratch stay local.
agents.local.md
agents.*.md
agents (*).md
AGENTS.local.md
AGENTS.*.md
AGENTS (*).md
claude.local.md
claude.*.md
claude (*).md
CLAUDE.local.md
CLAUDE.*.md
CLAUDE (*).md
.claude/settings.local.json
# Local hosted job-import diagnostics are not source artifacts.
hosted-job-import*.log
hosted-job-import*.json
hosted-job-bug-audit*.log
hosted-job-bug-audit*.json
hosted-job-fix*.log
hosted-job-fix*.json
hosted-job-fix*.prof
hosted-job-local-commit*.log
hosted-matching-push*.log
hosted-matching-push-verification*.log
hosted-main-integration*.log
hosted-main-push-verification*.log
hosted-main-final-push*.log
!/.gitignore
!/agents.md
!/claude.md
# Keep the canonical root WATCHER_PROGRESS.md tracked; ignore local copies.
WATCHER_PROGRESS.local.md
WATCHER_PROGRESS.*.md
WATCHER_PROGRESS (*).md
watcher/WATCHER_PROGRESS*.md
watcher/WATCHER_PROGRESS (*).md
!/WATCHER_PROGRESS.md
